    "story": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "theme_image": "about",
        "image_alt": "Two women laughing together on a beach in Mauritius",
        "flip": false,
        "eyebrow": "About Moana Beauté",
        "heading": "Made for every woman who calls the island home",
        "text": "<p>It started with a simple frustration. The Korean skincare everyone was talking about online was hard to find in Mauritius, or sold by people who couldn't say where it came from.</p><p>So we did it properly. Real products, honest prices, every ingredient listed, and delivery anywhere on the island.</p>",
        "script": "you already belong here",
        "link_label": "Read our story",
        "link_url": "shopify://pages/about"
      }
    },
    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Good to know",
        "heading": "You asked. We answered.",
        "text": "<p>Still wondering? <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Message us</a>, we're happy to help.</p>"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much is delivery?",
            "answer": "<p>Rs 100 anywhere in Mauritius, and free when your order is over Rs 1,500.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does delivery take?",
            "answer": "<p>Usually 1 to 3 working days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I collect my order instead?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, in Mon Gout. Email us or use the contact form and we'll find a time that works for you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I pay?",
            "answer": "<p>Securely at checkout. Your card details go straight to our payment provider, so we never see your full card number.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are the products authentic?",
            "answer": "<p>Always. Every product page shows the full ingredient list, so you can check it against the brand's own.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return a product?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, if it's unopened and in its original packaging, within seven days of delivery. Opened skincare can't come back for hygiene reasons, unless it's faulty or not what you ordered. All the details are on <a href=\"/pages/delivery\">Delivery &amp; returns</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I try something new?",
            "answer": "<p>Patch test first: a little on your inner arm or behind your ear, then wait a day. Our product info is not medical advice.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "question_1",
        "question_2",
        "question_3",
        "question_4",
        "question_5",
        "question_6",
        "question_7"
      ]
